While ferries regularly visit the nearby islands of Rolvsøya and Ingøya, the ferry to Måsøya operates on a different schedule and requires advance booking by phone. Måsøya is a small island just a 15-minute boat ride from Havøysund, making it a popular destination for fishing and exploration, but the need to call ahead sets it apart from the other islands in the area.

